window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He stole my first kiss in the dark.</b></p> <p>The shadows welcoming him like a lover's touch. Every night since, the dark brings him back to me.</p> <p>He's my demon, my nightmare, and my dream all rolled up into one.</p> <p>He tells me I'm his but during the day I cannot find him. Until my demon has no choice but to come for me, to save me, to rescue me from the tower I am locked away in.</p> <p>But does my black-eyed demon just wish to free me of those chains to fit his own? Or am I strong enough to break their lock and find the man underneath?</p> <p>Some loves are just meant to be deadly.</p> <p>Mine was set in stone from the first deadly encounter…</p> <p><i>Deadly Encounter</i> is the third book in the Deadly Love Series. Each book follows a different set of characters and can be enjoyed as a standalone, but the series is best listened to in order.</p>"; 
